### Kaizen Improvement

Title: Standardization of WinActor License Clearing Procedure

Support Reference No. 1: Get "Clear License" of Old PC in WinActor 7.6.1

Before:

\- No existing support reference or step-by-step instructions for clearing the WinActor license from an old PC.

After:

* Open WinActor 7.6.1.

* Select \[Help\] → \[Version\].

* Select \[Clear License\].

* Save the generated license-clearing ID for future reference.

Effectiveness:

* Provides a clear and easy-to-follow procedure for license clearing.

* Reduces time spent asking for technical assistance.

* Prevents confusion during PC replacement or license transfer.

* Improves efficiency and standardizes the license clearing process.



